{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":7,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"In the days of Ahaz the son of Jotham, the son of Uzziah, the king of Judah, Rezin the king of Aram and Pekah the son of Remaliah, the king of Israel, went up to Jerusalem to wage war against it, but they were not able to prevail against it.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Ahaz","s":["H0271"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jotham","s":["H3147"],"a":[4]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Uzziah","s":["H5818"],"a":[6]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Rezin","s":["H7526"],"a":[10]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of Aram and "},{"t":"Pekah","s":["H6492"],"a":[13]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Remaliah","s":["H7425"],"a":[15]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[17]},{"t":", went "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[18]},{"t":" to wage "},{"t":"war","s":["H4421"],"a":[19]},{"t":" against it, but they were not able to "},{"t":"prevail","s":["H3898"],"a":[23]},{"t":" against it."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And it was reported to the house of David that Aram allied with Ephraim, and his heart and the heart of his people quivered as the trees of the forest quiver in the face of a wind.","tok":[{"t":"And it was "},{"t":"reported","s":["H5046"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[2]},{"t":" that Aram allied with "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[7]},{"t":", and his "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[11]},{"t":" quivered as the "},{"t":"trees","s":["H6086"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of the forest quiver in the face of a "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Then Jehovah said to Isaiah, Go out to meet Ahaz, you and Shear-jashub your son, at the end of the conduit of the upper pool, on the road to the Fuller’s Field;","tok":[{"t":"Then","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Isaiah","s":["H3470"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Go out to "},{"t":"meet","s":["H7125"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Ahaz","s":["H0271"],"a":[7]},{"t":", you and "},{"t":"Shear","s":["H7610"],"a":[9]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"jashub","s":["H7610"],"a":[9]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[11]},{"t":", at the "},{"t":"end","s":["H7097"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"conduit","s":["H8585"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"upper","s":["H5945"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"pool","s":["H1295"],"a":[15]},{"t":", on the "},{"t":"road","s":["H4546"],"a":[18]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"Fuller’s","s":["H3526"],"a":[20]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Field","s":["H7704"],"a":[19]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":4,"text":"And say to him, Be careful and be quiet; do not fear, and do not be fainthearted because of these two smoking firebrand stubs, at the burning anger of Rezin and Aram, and the son of Remaliah.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to him, Be careful and be "},{"t":"quiet","s":["H8252"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; do not "},{"t":"fear","s":["H3372"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and do not be "},{"t":"fainthearted","s":["H7401"],"a":[8]},{"t":" because of these "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"smoking","s":["H6226"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"firebrand","s":["H0181"],"a":[11]},{"t":" stubs, at the burning "},{"t":"anger","s":["H0639"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Rezin","s":["H7526"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Aram","s":["H0758"],"a":[17]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Remaliah","s":["H7425"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Because Aram and Ephraim and the son of Remaliah have planned evil against you, saying,","tok":[{"t":"Because Aram and "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Remaliah","s":["H7425"],"a":[8]},{"t":" have planned "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" against you, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":","}]},{"n":6,"text":"Let us go up against Judah and make it sick with terror and break it open for ourselves, and let us set the son of Tabel in its midst as king;","tok":[{"t":"Let us go "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[0]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and make it sick with terror and break it open for ourselves, and let us "},{"t":"set","s":["H4427"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of Tabel in its "},{"t":"midst","s":["H8432"],"a":[7]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[6]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":7,"text":"Thus says the Lord Jehovah, It shall not stand, and it shall not happen;","tok":[{"t":"Thus","s":["H3541"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Jehovah, It shall not "},{"t":"stand","s":["H6965"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and it shall not happen;"}]},{"n":8,"text":"For the head of Aram is Damascus, And the head of Damascus is Rezin; And in another sixty-five years Ephraim will be shattered as a people.","tok":[{"t":"For the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Aram","s":["H0758"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"Damascus","s":["H1834"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Damascus","s":["H1834"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"Rezin","s":["H7526"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; And in another sixty-"},{"t":"five","s":["H2568"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[12]},{"t":" will be shattered as a "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"And the head of Ephraim is Samaria, And the head of Samaria is the son of Remaliah; If you do not believe, surely you will not remain standing.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"Samaria","s":["H8111"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Samaria","s":["H8111"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of Remaliah; If you do not "},{"t":"believe","s":["H0539"],"a":[9]},{"t":", surely you will not remain standing."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Then Jehovah spoke further to Ahaz, saying,","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H1696"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"further","s":["H3254"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Ahaz","s":["H0271"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":","}]},{"n":11,"text":"Ask for a sign from Jehovah your God; make it as deep as Sheol, or make it as high as high can go.","tok":[{"t":"Ask","s":["H7592"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for a "},{"t":"sign","s":["H0226"],"a":[2]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; make it as deep as Sheol, or make it as high as high can go."}]},{"n":12,"text":"And Ahaz said, I will not ask, and I will not try Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Ahaz","s":["H0271"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", I will not "},{"t":"ask","s":["H7592"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and I will not try "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And he said, Hear now, O house of David, is it too small a thing for you to exhaust the patience of men that you will exhaust the patience of my God as well?","tok":[{"t":"And he "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[1]},{"t":" now, O "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[4]},{"t":", is it too small a "},{"t":"thing","s":["H4592"],"a":[5]},{"t":" for you to exhaust the patience of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[8]},{"t":" that you will exhaust the patience of my "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[13]},{"t":" as well?"}]},{"n":14,"text":"Therefore the Lord Himself will give you a sign: Behold, the virgin will conceive and will bear a son, and she will call his name Immanuel.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Himself will "},{"t":"give","s":["H5414"],"a":[1]},{"t":" you a "},{"t":"sign","s":["H0226"],"a":[5]},{"t":": Behold, the "},{"t":"virgin","s":["H5959"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"conceive","s":["H2030"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and will "},{"t":"bear","s":["H3205"],"a":[9]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[10]},{"t":", and she will "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[11]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Immanuel","s":["H6005"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"He will eat curds and honey until he knows how to refuse evil and choose good.","tok":[{"t":"He will "},{"t":"eat","s":["H0398"],"a":[2]},{"t":" curds and "},{"t":"honey","s":["H1706"],"a":[1]},{"t":" until he "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[3]},{"t":" how to "},{"t":"refuse","s":["H3988"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"choose","s":["H0977"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"For before this boy knows how to refuse evil and choose good, the land whose two kings you dread will be abandoned.","tok":[{"t":"For before this boy "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[2]},{"t":" how to "},{"t":"refuse","s":["H3988"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"choose","s":["H0977"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[7]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0127"],"a":[9]},{"t":" whose two "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[15]},{"t":" you dread will be abandoned."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Jehovah will bring upon you and your people and the house of your father such days as have not been since the days when Ephraim turned away from Judah; He will bring upon you the king of Assyria.","tok":[{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[0]},{"t":" upon you and your "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of your father such "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[8]},{"t":" as have not been since the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[12]},{"t":" when "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[14]},{"t":" turned away from "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[16]},{"t":"; He will bring upon you the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Assyria","s":["H0804"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"And in that day Jehovah will whistle for the flies which are at the ends of the rivers of Egypt and for the bees which are in the land of Assyria.","tok":[{"t":"And in that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will whistle for the flies which are at the ends of the "},{"t":"rivers","s":["H2975"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and for the bees which are in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Assyria","s":["H0804"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"And they will all come and settle in the steep ravines and the clefts of the cliffs and on all the thornbushes and on all watering places.","tok":[{"t":"And they will all "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and settle in the steep ravines and the clefts of the cliffs and on all the thornbushes and on all watering places."}]},{"n":20,"text":"In that day the Lord will shave with the razor hired from beyond the River, with the king of Assyria, the head and the hair of the legs; and it will take away the beard as well.","tok":[{"t":"In that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"shave","s":["H1548"],"a":[2]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"razor","s":["H8593"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"hired","s":["H7917"],"a":[5]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"beyond","s":["H5676"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"River","s":["H5104"],"a":[7]},{"t":", with the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Assyria","s":["H0804"],"a":[9]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"hair","s":["H8181"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the legs; and it will take away the "},{"t":"beard","s":["H2206"],"a":[16]},{"t":" as well."}]},{"n":21,"text":"And in that day each man will keep alive only a milk cow and two females of the flock.","tok":[{"t":"And in that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" each "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will keep alive only a milk "},{"t":"cow","s":["H5697"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[7]},{"t":" females of the flock."}]},{"n":22,"text":"And because of the abundance of milk produced, he will eat curds; for everyone left behind in the midst of the land will eat curds and honey.","tok":[{"t":"And because of the "},{"t":"abundance","s":["H7230"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"milk","s":["H2461"],"a":[3]},{"t":" produced, he will "},{"t":"eat","s":["H0398"],"a":[4]},{"t":" curds; for everyone "},{"t":"left","s":["H3498"],"a":[11]},{"t":" behind in the midst of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[13]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"eat","s":["H0398"],"a":[9]},{"t":" curds and "},{"t":"honey","s":["H1706"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":23,"text":"And in that day every place where there could be a thousand vines, worth a thousand shekels of silver, will become thorns and thistles.","tok":[{"t":"And in that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" every "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[5]},{"t":" where there could be a "},{"t":"thousand","s":["H0505"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vines","s":["H1612"],"a":[10]},{"t":", worth a "},{"t":"thousand","s":["H0505"],"a":[11]},{"t":" shekels of silver, will become "},{"t":"thorns","s":["H7898"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and thistles."}]},{"n":24,"text":"Men will come there with arrows and bow, for all the land will be thorns and thistles.","tok":[{"t":"Men will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[2]},{"t":" there with "},{"t":"arrows","s":["H2671"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"bow","s":["H7198"],"a":[1]},{"t":", for "},{"t":"all","s":["H0935"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H8068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"thorns","s":["H7898"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and thistles."}]},{"n":25,"text":"And to all the hills that once were hoed with the hoe you will not go for fear of thorns and thistles; but they will become a place for cattle to roam in and for sheep to trample.","tok":[{"t":"And to all the "},{"t":"hills","s":["H2022"],"a":[1]},{"t":" that once were hoed with the hoe you will not go for "},{"t":"fear","s":["H3374"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"thorns","s":["H7898"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and thistles; but they will become a place for "},{"t":"cattle","s":["H7716"],"a":[15]},{"t":" to roam in and for sheep to trample."}]}]}
